'''Pokémon Adventures: The Gastly Ghosts''' is the fifth monthly issue of the [[Pokémon Adventures]] {{pkmn|manga}} released by [[VIZ Media]]. It contains chapters thirteen, fourteen, and fifteen of the {{MangaArc|Red, Green & Blue}}. The chapters originally released in this book were later compiled into the final two chapters of {{PAV|1}} and the first chapter of {{PAV|2}}. As a bonus, it contained a sheet of Pokémon stickers which were not included with the collected volume release.

